    "do": [
      "The existing ANN Worker binds the existing private main-scope observation bridge before loading its runtime. It never initializes or consumes the native decoder.",
      "Held binary and immediate-parent descriptors use exact BigInt device/inode/mode metadata. Unknown and foreign ownership refuse before module execution; root/caller grants preserve type, symlink, POSIX mode, digest, version and pre/post-load identity checks.",
      "The existing index owner disposes the private observation authority on constructor/build/deadline/error/exit/eviction/reset/query-discard paths before termination. Existing cache, queue, protocol, thresholds and budgets remain. Ready plus a nonzero error refuses.",
      "The existing native-runtime Activity Log operation gains one optional closed Worker result, independently of cold digest resolution. The BFF supplies its existing process sink. No per-file/query event, path, descriptor, inode, UID, content, parallel writer or prompt is added.",
      "Cleanup propagates to the existing loader failure boundary; the canonical legacy-register prune removes one retired catch and adds no suppression. Generated operation contracts and inventories use the canonical producer."
    ],
